WHAT THE REQUEST-HOST TABLE PROVES
----------------------------------
Two hosts were contacted during the live tutor turn. localhost:8095 is the
static export itself (HTML, JS, fonts, content packs) and received ZERO
Authorization headers. api.openai.com received every one of them. No
WebSocket was opened at all, so no server of ours — and no relay — is in the
path. This is the escalation condition from the card, checked and NOT met.

